# Source files are checked out with LF on every platform, Windows included: Git for Windows turns them into CRLF
# by default, and the sidecar's tests read these files as text and match them line by line (respan-trace.test.mjs
# looks for `});` immediately followed by a newline), so a CRLF checkout failed on the Windows runner only.
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.rs text eol=lf
*.swift text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
